  "question": {
    "text": "Equal weights of $\\mathrm{CH}_{4}$ and $\\mathrm{H}_{2}$ are mixed in an empty container at $25^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$. the fraction of the total pressure exerted by $\\mathrm{H}_{2}$ is",
