  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Ratio of number of moles of $\\mathrm{CH}_{4}$ and $\\mathrm{H}_{2}$ are\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{r}\r\n\\mathrm{CH}_{4}: \\mathrm{H}_{2}=\\frac{x}{16} ; \\frac{x}{2} \\\\\r\n=1: 8\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\r\nHence, partial pressure exerted by\r\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{H}_{2}=\\frac{8}{1+8} \\times p_{\\text {total }}=\\frac{8}{9} \\times p_{\\text {lotal }}\r\n$$",
